{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港股升幅擴大，恒生指數較早時報22470點，升504點，升幅2.3%。<br/>\n<br/>\n科技指數升穿3500點關口，較早時報3502點，升124點，升幅近3.7%。<br/>\n<br/>\n三桶油升逾2%至近5%。晶片、AI相關股份反彈，中芯及華虹分別升近5%和近7%。MINIMAX及智譜分別急升逾12%和逾14%。<br/>\n<br/>\n理想汽車公布業績後急升近12%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：張詩民\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:59:24.125235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:40:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:56.161774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:52:47.725368+00:00","content_hash":"e8eeae9a84a66d0dd9754ae5d1a06714277b9e91a17e54723ccd9564eb5122c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}